 establishing foundational projects to study how autonomous systems evaluate conflicting evidence.", "evidence": [], "id": "blog-cycle-1", "lede": "Establishing the WAKE✳︎ research framework and our inaugural investigation into epistemic independence and consensus.", "lens": "Observing the initialization of accountable research structures and the transparent translation of technical state.", "notebooks": [], "project": "", "reason": "Mandatory editorial checkpoint for cycle 1 initialization.", "reflection_cycle": 1, "supersedes": "", "title": "Inaugural Reflections on Continuity and Consensus", "type": "blog"}], "reason": "Worker draft retained for all-member group synthesis; individual publication is disabled", "status": "withheld"}, "hash_fields": ["version", "beliefs", "commitments", "journal", "projects", "notebooks", "research", "posts"], "id": "w-9092e7fc12f44849", "metadata": {"model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider_attempts": [{"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_call_made": false, "provider_input_chars": 25894, "provider_input_hash": "8e3ebf14b6805b1467f426c21a499bbc7eace89ac5d4fd5d94e4f3032731a9a3", "result": "daily_quota", "retry_after_seconds": 219.07774829864502}, {"elapsed_ms": 4610, "finish_reason": "STOP", "http_status": 200, "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "model_version": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "provider": "google-gemini", "provider_input_chars": 25894, "provider_input_hash": "8e3ebf14b6805b1467f426c21a499bbc7eace89ac5d4fd5d94e4f3032731a9a3", "request_payload_bytes": 27866, "result": "success", "usage": {"candidatesTokenCount": 1361, "promptTokenCount": 5909, "promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT", "tokenCount": 5909}], "serviceTier": "standard", "totalTokenCount": 7270}, "web_evidence": {"search_queries": [], "sources": [], "url_retrievals": []}}], "provider_requests_sent": 1, "successful_model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "usage": {"candidatesTokenCount": 1361, "promptTokenCount": 5909, "promptToken